  "change": "An unmapped tagged Identity CID is a glyph identifier, not a Unicode scalar. word_text now emits U+FFFD rather than text_char(cid_char(cid)). Existing verified CID/PUA dictionaries, whole-word compound decoders, source-verified AJ1 candidates and literal Unicode retain their priority and behavior. Original raw source symbols/boxes remain available.",
