    "new_font_name_title_company_page_PUA_or_CID_value_dispatch": false,
    "new_mapping_entries": 0,
    "unknown_source_is_not_arbitrarily_cast_to_a_different_character": true,
    "not_a_claim_that_legacy_rules_are_all_generalized": true
  },
  "limits": "Does not restore the original unknown character. Some of these occurrences are drawn grouping-brace parts; others are name variants or a compound numeral. OCR remains explicit opt-in, NDLOCR0.0.15 rev f97e930b8c3e9512f7788f258ef685da26416483. No added semantic model. Issue227 remains active; no full-corpus accuracy estimate.",
